{"id":"n62053-4-12","stage":2,"title":"세기 · 世纪","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62053-4-12-1","ko":"저희 할아버지는 올해로 아흔 다섯이세요.","zh":"我们爷爷今年九十五岁了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"할아버지는","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지는","audio":"/audio/79b99d3d9d90dd48ec43.mp3"}},{"text":"올해로","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해로","audio":"/audio/5f3f2b6e04a000c0eacf.mp3"}},{"text":"아흔","meaning":"九十","explanation":"아흔：九十","readings":[{"term":"아흔","audio":"/audio/87bbeaa4582f0895f511.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93507","senseId":"1","lemma":"아흔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아흔","audio":"/audio/87bbeaa4582f0895f511.mp3"}},{"text":"다섯이세요.","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다섯이세요","audio":"/audio/87449a1882ff01175d5c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"6600340