dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가까운","audio":"/audio/ae733feeb8d75aeaad68.mp3"}},{"text":"세월을","meaning":"岁月，光阴，年华，时光","explanation":"세월：岁月，光阴，年华，时光；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"세월","audio":"/audio/54d9aa79a74486473c4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49225","senseId":"1","lemma":"세월","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세월을","audio":"/audio/805ffc9aaf3458de2127.mp3"}},{"text":"살아","meaning":"活，活着，生存","explanation":"살다：活，活着，生存；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"1","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아","audio":"/audio/30d811da4a1eb958a364.mp3"}},{"text":"오셨네요.","meaning":"至今，到现在","explanation":"오다：至今，到现在；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69517","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오셨네요","audio":"/audio/3cd31faf989193f5a3db.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1b1da423b101b551","term":"거의","zh":"几乎，快要","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3","entryId":"60090","definition":"离某个状态或限度很近。","pronunciation":["거의","거이"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一（한 세기：一个世纪）","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一（한 세기：一个世纪）","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"d8487835cc2b3df1","term":"세기","zh":"世纪","audio":"/audio/d8487835cc2b3df19f53.mp3","entryId":"62053","definition":"计算年代的单位，一个世纪是一百年。","pronunciation":["세ː기"]},{"id":"9ff63e71387c2c60","term":"가깝다","zh":"接近，近","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3","entryId":"65200","definition":"几乎到达某个数值。","pronunciation":["가깝따"]},{"id":"54d9aa79a7448647","term":"세월","zh":"岁月，光阴，年华，时光","audio":"/audio/54d9aa79a74486473c4b.mp3","entryId":"49225","definition":"流逝的时间。","pronunciation":["세ː월"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"活，活着，生存","aud